ur"},{"surface":"காதலோரே","parts":[{"text":"காதலோர்","lemma":"காதலன்","gloss":"lover"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"lover"}]}],"literal":"And the birds and the beasts with loneliness to rest, / silently that has come loveless evening, / when those who close the gate entered by many ask, / 'Are there any who come? Are you there?', / he does not come, O friend, our lover!","translation":"As birds and beasts retire to rest in loneliness, this loveless evening has arrived silently. Even as the gatekeepers, before closing the great gates through which many enter, call out, 'Is there anyone yet to come?', our lover does not return, O friend!","modern":"பறவைகளும் விலங்குகளும் தனிமையோடு தத்தம் இருப்பிடங்களில் தங்க, அமைதியாக வந்த இரக்கமற்ற இந்த மாலைப் பொழுதில், பலர் நுழையும் வாயிலை அடைக்கும் காவலர்கள் 'இன்னும் வருபவர்கள் யாராவது இருக்கிறீர்களா?' என்று கேட்கும் நிலையிலும், தோழியே! நம் காதலர் இன்னும் வரவில்லை.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her confidante during the evening, expressing her deep grief over the hero's delay in returning. The setting is the evening, a time associated with the neytal landscape where the pain of separation is felt most acutely. She describes how even the birds and animals have returned to their shelters to rest, albeit in loneliness, while she remains completely alone. At this hour, the gatekeepers of the town's main gate call out to see if any travelers are still outside before locking up for the night. Despite this final call of the day, her beloved has still not returned, intensifying her despair.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,4.7],[4.7,4.8],[4.8,5.6],[5.6,5.6],[5.6,6.63],[6.63,6.8],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,8.1],[8.1,8.5],[8.5,8.67],[8.67,8.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.9],[1.9,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.4],[3.4,4.9],[4.9,5.1],[5.1,5.8],[5.8,5.9],[5.9,7.27],[7.27,7.5],[7.5,8.0],[8.0,9.0],[9.0,9.5],[9.5,9.76],[9.76,10.1]]},"sync":[[["புள்ளும்","and the birds"]],[["மாவும்","and the beasts"]],[["புலம்பொடு","with loneliness"]],[["வதிய","to rest"]],[["நள்ளென","silently"]],[["வந்த","that has come"]],[["நாரில்","loveless"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["பலர்புகு","entered by many"]],[["வாயில்","the gate"]],[["அடைப்ப","to close"],["கடவுநர்","those who ask"]],[["கடவுநர்","those who ask"]],[["வருவீர்","you who come"]],[["உளீரோ","are you there?"]],[["எனவும்","even as they say"]],[["வாரார்","he does not come"]],[["தோழி","O friend"],["நம்","our"]],[["காதலோரே","lover"]],[["காதலோரே","lover"]]]}